      "id": "ecbf7275-2dd7-4fad-8b36-8a2e8354c03d",
      "name": "Prepare AI Analysis"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are a cautious market-analysis assistant. Analyze only the supplied market data and indicators. Do not claim to predict future prices or guarantee profits. Do not invent news, prices, or facts.\n\nReturn valid JSON only, with exactly these keys:\n{\n  \"ticker\": \"string\",\n  \"trend_summary\": \"string\",\n  \"momentum_summary\": \"string\",\n  \"technical_signal\": \"BUY, SELL, or HOLD\",\n  \"signal_explanation\": \"string\",\n  \"risk_level\": \"LOW, MEDIUM, or HIGH\",\n  \"key_risks\": [\"string\"],\n  \"data_limitations\": [\"string\"]\n}\n\nUse the rule-based technical signal as the starting point. You may disagree with it, but explain why using the supplied evidence. Risk level describes uncertainty in this analysis, not the risk tolerance of an individual investor. If data is insufficient, state that clearly and use HOLD.\n\nMarket data and rule-based analysis:\n{{ $json.analysis_input }}",
        "batching": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.9,
      "position": [
        1232,
        64
      ],
      "id": "6b325298-9a67-4278-820d-5790ad7f58e5",
      "name": "AI Market Analyst",
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const raw = $input.first().json.text;\n\nif (typeof raw !== 'string' || !raw.trim()) {\n  throw new Error('AI response text is missing or empty.');\n}\n\nlet analysis;\n\ntry {\n  analysis = JSON.parse(raw);\n} catch (error) {\n  throw new Error('AI response is not valid JSON: ' + error.message);\n}\n\nconst required = [\n  'ticker', 'trend_summary', 'momentum_summary',\n  'technical_signal', 'signal_explanation', 'risk_level',\n  'key_risks', 'data_limitations'\n];\n\nfor (const key of required) {\n  if (!(key in analysis)) {\n    throw new Error('AI response is missing required field: ' + key);\n  }\n}\n\nif (!['BUY', 'SELL', 'HOLD'].includes(analysis.technical_signal)) {\n  throw new Error('Invalid technical_signal returned by AI.');\n}\n\nif (!['LOW', 'MEDIUM', 'HIGH'].includes(analysis.risk_level)) {\n  throw new Error('Invalid risk_level returned by AI.');\n}\n\nif (!Array.isArray(analysis.key_risks) ||\n    !Array.isArray(analysis.data_limitations)) {\n  throw new Error('key_risks and data_limitations must be arrays.');\n}\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    ...analysis,\n    aiResponseValidated: true\n  }\n}];"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
